{"unit_id": "tag:04DZ:statement", "translation": "<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。假设<MATH_0002>是整（integral）、普遍（universally）单射（injective）且满射（surjective）的（即<MATH_0003>是普遍同胚（universal homeomorphism），见《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>）。函子（functor）<MATH_0004>定义范畴等价（equivalence of categories）<MATHSEG_0001>概形（schemes）<MATHSEG_0002>平展（<MATHSEG_0003>tale）于<MATHSEG_0004>概形（schemes）<MATHSEG_0005>平展（<MATHSEG_0006>tale）于<MATHSEG_0007>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整"}, {"source_term": "universally", "target_term": "普遍"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "<MATHSEG_0003>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "<MATHSEG_0006>tale", "target_term": "平展"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定概形和两类平展概形。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "给定的概形态射。"}, {"source_term": "integral", "target_term": "整", "context": "态射的整性。"}, {"source_term": "universally", "target_term": "普遍", "context": "单射在所有基变换后保持。"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射", "context": "普遍单射条件。"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射", "context": "给定态射的满射性。"}, {"source_term": "universal homeomorphism", "target_term": "普遍同胚", "context": "与所列条件等价。"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "定义等价的函子。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_